I came to tell you to come to our house this afternoon.

77
00:04:59,666 --> 00:05:00,433
What’s the news?

78
00:05:00,533 --> 00:05:01,100
I don’t know!

79
00:05:01,133 --> 00:05:03,766
Babajoon said the kids should come to our house this afternoon.

80
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:07,566
If you feel like it, come a bit earlier.

81
00:05:14,933 --> 00:05:17,766
(Sound of a wall clock)

82
00:05:20,266 --> 00:05:21,933
On a hot summer day,

83
00:05:22,066 --> 00:05:23,766
Exactly on the thirteenth of Mordad,

84
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:26,066
Around a quarter to three in the afternoon,

85
00:05:26,100 --> 00:05:27,100
I fell in love!

86
00:05:27,700 --> 00:05:29,500
I, who was Agha Jan’s son,

87
00:05:29,666 --> 00:05:32,933
Fell in love with Leili, Dear Uncle Napoleon’s daughter.

88
00:05:33,366 --> 00:05:35,433
Exactly as if Churchill’s son,

89
00:05:35,533 --> 00:05:37,466
Fell in love with Hitler’s daughter!

90
00:05:41,866 --> 00:05:42,700
Hello, Dear Shajoon.

91
00:05:42,933 --> 00:05:44,266
You didn’t sleep again?

92
00:05:44,666 --> 00:05:45,900
They came for me.

93
00:05:47,100 --> 00:05:48,466
Where are you off to in the midday heat?

94
00:05:48,900 --> 00:05:49,900
Dear Uncle’s house.

95
00:05:50,666 --> 00:05:51,766
Which Dear Uncle?

96
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,600
Dear Uncle, of course! Leili came to tell me.

97
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:56,900
You've been stirring up trouble again

98
00:05:56,966 --> 00:05:57,900
No, Dear Shajoon!

99
00:05:57,933 --> 00:05:59,266
I don’t know what they want.

100
00:05:59,266 --> 00:06:01,166
Leili said all the kids should gather there.

101
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,100
Eat a slice of watermelon and go.

102
00:06:03,366 --> 00:06:04,566
Alright, I’ll be back.

103
00:06:05,333 --> 00:06:06,166
Goodbye.

104
00:06:08,533 --> 00:06:10,500
I don’t get what your brother,

105
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:12,066
Wants with the kids.

106
00:06:12,266 --> 00:06:13,300
Once a week,

107
00:06:13,333 --> 00:06:15,666
He gathers the family kids to lecture them.

108
00:06:15,700 --> 00:06:16,266
Is there a problem with that?

109
00:06:16,266 --> 00:06:17,200
This brother of yours,

110
00:06:17,233 --> 00:06:19,666
Takes out his anger at Liakhov’s disobedient Cossacks,

111
